<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Arcade Hub</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root{
    --bg: #100c1c;
    --panel: #191330;
    --line: #2c2450;
    --accent: #ffd166;
    --accent2: #06d6a0;
    --text: #f2f0fb;
    --dim: #9c94c2;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body{
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, #241c46 0%, var(--bg) 55%);
    font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .wrap{
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 60px;
  }

  header{
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  h1{
    font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  header p{
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .card{
    display: block;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .card:hover{
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .card .tag{
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bg);
    background: var(--accent2);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .card h2{
    font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .card p{
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .card .play{
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .card .play::after{
    content: ' →';
  }

  footer{
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 48px;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <h1>ARCADE HUB</h1>
    <p>Seven quick browser games. Pick one and play.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="riftrunner.html">
      <span class="tag">Reflex</span>
      <h2>Riftrunner</h2>
      <p>Dodge falling shards that speed up nonstop. Chain near-misses for combo points.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="canyon-sprint.html">
      <span class="tag">Reflex</span>
      <h2>Canyon Sprint</h2>
      <p>Endless runner — jump and double-jump over rocks and gaps as the pace ramps up.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="colorburst.html">
      <span class="tag">Reflex</span>
      <h2>Colorburst</h2>
      <p>Stroop-effect speed test — tap the ink color, not the word, before the timer runs out.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="pulse-line.html">
      <span class="tag">Rhythm</span>
      <h2>Pulse Line</h2>
      <p>Hit D / F / J right as notes cross the line. Tempo increases, timing gets tighter.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="flappy-finch.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Flappy Finch</h2>
      <p>Tap to flap and thread the gaps between hedges. One clip ends the run.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="block-drop.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Block Drop</h2>
      <p>Stack falling pieces, clear full rows, survive the speed increases as you level up.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="merge-2048.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Merge Drift</h2>
      <p>Slide tiles together to merge matching numbers. Reach 2048 to win.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="brick-breaker.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Brick Breaker</h2>
      <p>Bounce the ball off your paddle to smash every brick before you run out of lives.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="maze-muncher.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Maze Muncher</h2>
      <p>Eat every dot in the maze while three ghosts hunt you. Power orbs turn the tables.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="pong-duel.html">
      <span class="tag">Classic</span>
      <h2>Pong Duel</h2>
      <p>First to 7 points against an AI that gets sharper the longer the rally runs.</p>
      <span class="play">Play</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <footer>Open any card to play — all games run locally in your browser.</footer>
</div>

</body>
</html>
